### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = "demo2@example.com"

### create share
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shares
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "email": {{email}}
}

### get shares
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shares
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### get received shares
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shares/received
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
